  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Third Stone from the Sun, Lenny**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Lonely People**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance; with Talib Kweli [2]\n- **Nautilus**: back after 21 archived shows (610 days); rare: 4 archived performances; with Talib Kweli & Niko Is [2]\n- **Get By**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance; with Talib Kweli, Niko Is & Adam Deitch [2]\n- **Manic Depression**: with Brandon \"Taz\" Neiderauer [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Soulive2014-11-14.BearCreek** (recommended): source not stated; 12 songs; 89 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Brandon \"Taz\" Neiderauer, Talib Kweli, Talib Kweli & Niko Is, Talib Kweli, Niko Is & Adam Deitch [1]\n- Show took place at the Purple Hat Stage at Bear Creek Music Festival in Live Oak, Florida [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Soulive2014-11-14.BearCreek**: Recorded with Schoeps MK21 capsules and CMC6 amplifiers into a Sound Devices 722 recorder [1]",
